{"page":280,"width":1717,"height":2287,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"이제 위반될 수 있는 규칙은 \u0027뿌리 노드는 김은짹이어야 한다\u0027와 \u0027활간색 노 亡의 자식들은 모두 검은","words":[{"text":"이제","x":237,"y":194,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"위반될","x":315,"y":192,"width":93,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":420,"y":193,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"있는","x":462,"y":192,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"규칙은","x":528,"y":192,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"\u0027뿌리","x":624,"y":191,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"노드는","x":700,"y":193,"width":87,"height":29},{"text":"김은짹이어야","x":798,"y":192,"width":174,"height":32},{"text":"한다\u0027와","x":980,"y":192,"width":99,"height":32},{"text":"\u0027활간색","x":1087,"y":193,"width":91,"height":31},{"text":"노","x":1193,"y":195,"width":22,"height":23},{"text":"亡의","x":1222,"y":192,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"자식들은","x":1286,"y":192,"width":119,"height":31},{"text":"모두","x":1413,"y":192,"width":60,"height":29},{"text":"검은","x":1484,"y":191,"width":61,"height":31}]},{"text":"색이다\u0027 두 가지로 좁혀집니다. 두 가지 중 \u0027뿌리 노드는 검은책이어야 한다\u0027라는 규칙의 뒤처리는","words":[{"text":"색이다\u0027","x":237,"y":253,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"두","x":359,"y":254,"width":32,"height":30},{"text":"가지로","x":404,"y":252,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"좁혀집니다.","x":504,"y":252,"width":152,"height":31},{"text":"두","x":671,"y":253,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"가지","x":713,"y":251,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"중","x":782,"y":253,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"\u0027뿌리","x":824,"y":252,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"노드는","x":901,"y":255,"width":89,"height":29},{"text":"검은책이어야","x":1002,"y":253,"width":172,"height":32},{"text":"한다\u0027라는","x":1184,"y":253,"width":126,"height":31},{"text":"규칙의","x":1321,"y":252,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"뒤처리는","x":1424,"y":251,"width":121,"height":31}]},{"text":"간단합니다. 뿌리 노드를 무조건 검은색으로 칠하면 되니까요. 이제 우리가 염려해야 하는 규칙은","words":[{"text":"간단합니다.","x":236,"y":313,"width":170,"height":33},{"text":"뿌리","x":423,"y":312,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"노드를","x":494,"y":313,"width":88,"height":30},{"text":"무조건","x":593,"y":312,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"검은색으로","x":694,"y":312,"width":143,"height":31},{"text":"칠하면","x":850,"y":313,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"되니까요.","x":948,"y":314,"width":122,"height":31},{"text":"이제","x":1086,"y":314,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"우리가","x":1155,"y":313,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"염려해야","x":1254,"y":313,"width":115,"height":31},{"text":"하는","x":1381,"y":313,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"규칙은","x":1451,"y":312,"width":93,"height":31}]},{"text":"한 가지로 좁혀집니다.","words":[{"text":"한","x":236,"y":376,"width":35,"height":31},{"text":"가지로","x":282,"y":375,"width":96,"height":32},{"text":"좁혀집니다.","x":388,"y":373,"width":155,"height":32}]},{"text":"“할간책 자식은 모두 검은색이다.•","words":[{"text":"“할간책","x":676,"y":474,"width":85,"height":28},{"text":"자식은","x":849,"y":475,"width":73,"height":27},{"text":"모두","x":928,"y":476,"width":51,"height":26},{"text":"검은색이다.•","x":987,"y":474,"width":136,"height":29}]},{"text":"이 규칙이 위반되었다면 삽입한 노드와 부모 노드의 색이 모두 할간색이라는 뜻입니다. 이 상황은","words":[{"text":"이","x":239,"y":569,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"규칙이","x":286,"y":569,"width":95,"height":32},{"text":"위반되었다면","x":398,"y":568,"width":176,"height":32},{"text":"삽입한","x":587,"y":568,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"노드와","x":685,"y":569,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"부모","x":784,"y":569,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"노드의","x":853,"y":569,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"색이","x":952,"y":569,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"모두","x":1021,"y":571,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"할간색이라는","x":1091,"y":568,"width":171,"height":33},{"text":"뜻입니다.","x":1271,"y":568,"width":121,"height":31},{"text":"이","x":1409,"y":568,"width":26,"height":31},{"text":"상황은","x":1449,"y":568,"width":94,"height":32}]},{"text":"삽입한 노드의 삼촌이 어떤 색인가에 따라 다시 세 가지 경우로 나뉩니다. 여기에서 삼촌 노드는 다","words":[{"text":"삽입한","x":238,"y":630,"width":101,"height":32},{"text":"노드의","x":349,"y":631,"width":92,"height":31},{"text":"삼촌이","x":454,"y":630,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"어떤","x":554,"y":630,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"색인가에","x":622,"y":630,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"따라","x":748,"y":630,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"다시","x":816,"y":630,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"세","x":883,"y":631,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"가지","x":923,"y":630,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"경우로","x":991,"y":630,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"나뉩니다.","x":1086,"y":630,"width":120,"height":32},{"text":"여기에서","x":1221,"y":629,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"삼촌","x":1342,"y":629,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"노드는","x":1409,"y":631,"width":91,"height":29},{"text":"다","x":1510,"y":630,"width":32,"height":31}]},{"text":"름 아닌 부모 노드의 둘도 없는 형제 노드를 말합니다. 레드 블랙 트리는 자식 노드가 둘뿐인 이진","words":[{"text":"름","x":237,"y":693,"width":35,"height":30},{"text":"아닌","x":285,"y":691,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"부모","x":363,"y":692,"width":64,"height":31},{"text":"노드의","x":439,"y":692,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"둘도","x":539,"y":693,"width":59,"height":29},{"text":"없는","x":612,"y":691,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"형제","x":681,"y":692,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"노드를","x":749,"y":693,"width":87,"height":30},{"text":"말합니다.","x":846,"y":692,"width":121,"height":32},{"text":"레드","x":984,"y":692,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"블랙","x":1050,"y":692,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"트리는","x":1120,"y":692,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"자식","x":1217,"y":691,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"노드가","x":1283,"y":690,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"둘뿐인","x":1378,"y":691,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"이진","x":1479,"y":691,"width":59,"height":32}]},{"text":"트리니까요.","words":[{"text":"트리니까요.","x":237,"y":753,"width":171,"height":32}]},{"text":"부모 노드가 (할아버지 노드의) 왼쪽 자식일 때 다음 세 가지 상황 중 하u뗴 해당되면 0번 규칙을","words":[{"text":"부모","x":237,"y":826,"width":67,"height":31},{"text":"노드가","x":315,"y":824,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"(할아버지","x":428,"y":824,"width":128,"height":33},{"text":"노드의)","x":569,"y":824,"width":100,"height":32},{"te